'''GIANTX''' is a [[:category:Europe|European]] esports organization, which was created through a merger with '''[[Excel Esports]]''', a [[:Category:United Kingdom|British]] esports organization, and '''[[Giants]]''', a [[:Category:Spain|Spanish]] esports organization.

